{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "weather.rain.forecast",
      "topic": "weather.rain.forecast",
      "triggers": [
        "StateChanged",
        "Idle"
      ],
      "priority": "Need",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact": "weather.phase",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "Forecast"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        "云压得很低，天气要变了",
        "得赶紧把外面的事收个尾"
      ],
      "localizedLines": { "en": ["Those clouds are hanging low. The weather's about to turn.", "I'd better finish up what I'm doing outside."] },
      "duration": 3.5,
      "cooldown": 75,
      "once": false,
      "completionFlag": "",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "weather.rain.exposed",
      "topic": "weather.rain.exposed",
      "triggers": [
        "StateChanged",
        "Idle"
      ],
      "priority": "Critical",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact": "weather.isRaining",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "True"
        },
        {
          "fact": "temperature.current",
          "operator": "Less",
          "value": "15"
        },
        {
          "fact": "weather.isExposed",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "True"
        },
        {
          "fact": "weather.isSnowing",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "False"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        "雨水太冷了，我得找个火源",
        "再淋下去体温会撑不住"
      ],
      "localizedLines": { "en": ["This rain is freezing. I need to find a fire.", "If I stay out in this rain, I'll get dangerously cold."] },
      "duration": 3.8,
      "cooldown": 45,
      "once": false,
      "completionFlag": "",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "weather.rain.heavy",
      "topic": "weather.rain.heavy",
      "triggers": [
        "StateChanged",
        "Idle"
      ],
      "priority": "Critical",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact": "weather.phase",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "RainHeavy"
        },
        {
          "fact": "weather.isSnowing",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "False"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        "雨势变大了，现在不适合远行",
        "这场雨越来越急了"
      ],
      "localizedLines": { "en": ["The rain's getting heavier. This is no time for a long trip.", "This downpour keeps getting worse."] },
      "duration": 3.6,
      "cooldown": 60,
      "once": false,
      "completionFlag": "",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "weather.rain.heat",
      "topic": "weather.rain.heat",
      "triggers": [
        "StateChanged",
        "Idle"
      ],
      "priority": "Need",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact": "weather.isRaining",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "True"
        },
        {
          "fact": "weather.hasHeatSource",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "True"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        "靠着火暖一会儿，体温正在恢复",
        "火还燃着，先在这里避避雨"
      ],
      "localizedLines": { "en": ["I'll warm up by the fire for a while.", "The fire's still burning. I'll shelter here until the rain eases."] },
      "duration": 3.5,
      "cooldown": 70,
      "once": false,
      "completionFlag": "",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "weather.rain.recovery",
      "topic": "weather.rain.recovery",
      "triggers": [
        "StateChanged",
        "Idle"
      ],
      "priority": "Ambient",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact": "weather.phase",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "Recovery"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        "雨停了，空气还很凉",
        "雨势过去了，可以重新安排外出了"
      ],
      "localizedLines": { "en": ["The rain has stopped, but the air is still chilly.", "The storm has passed. I can head out again."] },
      "duration": 3.4,
      "cooldown": 80,
      "once": false,
      "completionFlag": "",
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "id": "weather.snow.exposed",
      "topic": "weather.snow.exposed",
      "triggers": [
        "StateChanged",
        "Idle"
      ],
      "priority": "Critical",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact": "weather.isSnowing",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "True"
        },
        {
          "fact": "weather.isExposed",
          "operator": "Equal",
          "value": "True"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        "雪越下越冷，我得找个火源",
        "积雪开始变厚了，得准备好保暖和食物"
      ],
      "localizedLines": { "en": ["It's getting colder as the snow falls. I need a fire.", "The snow is piling up. I should prepare warm clothes and food."] },
      "duration": 3.8,
      "cooldown": 45,
      "once": false,
      "completionFlag": "",
      "enabled": true
    }
  ]
}
